flowchart TD
  accTitle: A simplified ComfyUI video graph
  accDescr: Prompt conditioning, an optional reference image, and compatible model components feed generation. Decoding produces frames and audio which are saved as a video.
  A["Prompt and scene action"] --> B["Text conditioning"]
  C["Reference frame, when used"] --> E["Video generation stages"]
  B --> E
  D["Compatible model, encoder, and settings"] --> E
  E --> F["Decode frames and supported audio"]
  F --> G["Save video"]
  G --> H["Inspect motion and continuity"]
  H -.->|Change the relevant input| A
